**POST /api/v1/memos**

The `CreateMemo` RPC declares its REST mapping via a `google.api.http` annotation in `proto/api/v1/memo_service.proto:21-25`:

```proto
rpc CreateMemo(CreateMemoRequest) returns (Memo) {
  option (google.api.http) = {
    post: "/api/v1/memos"
    body: "memo"
  };
}
```

This is confirmed in the generated gateway (`proto/gen/api/v1/memo_service.pb.gw.go:968`), where the handler is registered with `WithHTTPPathPattern("/api/v1/memos")` for the `CreateMemo` method.
